  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of the absence of a Tree Survey, Arboricultural Impact Assessment, Arboricultural Method Statement and Tree Protection Plan prepared in accordance with BS5837:2012, has failed to demonstrate that the proposed works would not adversely affect the root protection areas, long-term health and amenity value of nearby protected trees. In the absence of sufficient arboricultural information, the Local Planning Authority cannot be satisfied that the development would adequately protect existing trees of significant amenity value. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy G7 of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010), Policy DMD80 of the Development Management Document (2014), and the National Planning Policy Framework."
